---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Download Pulse: macOS App and Linux Agent"
  description="Download Pulse for macOS (Universal, Apple Silicon, Intel) and standalone Linux agent binaries (amd64, arm64). Zero tracking, direct binaries."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-title">Download Pulse</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Native Swift client for macOS workstations and standalone Go agent for Linux servers.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <!-- Section: macOS Client -->
      <div class="section-header" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 28px;">
        <span class="section-tag">macOS Client</span>
        <h2>Pulse for macOS</h2>
        <p>Requires macOS 13.0 (Ventura) or later. Includes built-in Sparkle auto-updates.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="download-grid">
        <!-- Universal DMG (Highlight) -->
        <div class="download-card highlight">
          <div class="download-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 17 2.94 12.45 4.7 9.39c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.81-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M15.97 6.37c.61-.75 1.04-1.8 1.01-2.87-.96.04-2.13.65-2.79 1.43-.58.67-1.1 1.76-1.02 2.81 1.07.08 2.19-.61 2.8-1.37z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="download-card-title">Universal DMG</h3>
          <p class="download-card-meta">Runs on Apple Silicon and Intel Macs. Single universal installer (7.5 MB).</p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/miftahganzz/Pulse/releases/latest/download/Pulse-1.0.5.dmg" 
            class="btn btn-primary"
            style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;"
          >
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg>
            <span>Download Pulse-1.0.5.dmg</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Apple Silicon arm64 -->
        <div class="download-card">
          <div class="download-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"></rect>
              <line x1="9" y1="1" x2="9" y2="4"></line>
              <line x1="15" y1="1" x2="15" y2="4"></line>
              <line x1="9" y1="20" x2="9" y2="23"></line>
              <line x1="15" y1="20" x2="15" y2="23"></line>
              <line x1="20" y1="9" x2="23" y2="9"></line>
              <line x1="20" y1="14" x2="23" y2="14"></line>
              <line x1="1" y1="9" x2="4" y2="9"></line>
              <line x1="1" y1="14" x2="4" y2="14"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="download-card-title">Apple Silicon (arm64)</h3>
          <p class="download-card-meta">Optimized for M1, M2, M3, and M4 processors (5.8 MB).</p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/miftahganzz/Pulse/releases/latest/download/Pulse-1.0.5-arm64.dmg" 
            class="btn btn-secondary"
            style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;"
          >
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg>
            <span>Pulse-1.0.5-arm64.dmg</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Intel x86_64 -->
        <div class="download-card">
          <div class="download-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line>
              <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="download-card-title">Intel 64-bit (x86_64)</h3>
          <p class="download-card-meta">For Intel-based Mac hardware on macOS 13.0+ (5.9 MB).</p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/miftahganzz/Pulse/releases/latest/download/Pulse-1.0.5-x86_64.dmg" 
            class="btn btn-secondary"
            style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;"
          >
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg>
            <span>Pulse-1.0.5-x86_64.dmg</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section: Linux Agent -->
      <div class="section-header" style="text-align: left; margin-top: 56px; margin-bottom: 28px;">
        <span class="section-tag">Server Daemon</span>
        <h2>Pulse Agent for Linux</h2>
        <p>Static Go binary with zero external library dependencies. Runs on systemd and crontab systems.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="download-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));">
        <!-- Linux x86_64 -->
        <div class="download-card">
          <div class="download-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6.01" y2="6"></line>
              <line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="download-card-title">Linux x86_64 (amd64)</h3>
          <p class="download-card-meta">Debian, Ubuntu, CentOS, Rocky Linux, Arch Linux, Alpine (7.1 MB).</p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/miftahganzz/Pulse/releases/latest/download/pulse-agent-linux-amd64" 
            class="btn btn-secondary"
            style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;"
          >
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg>
            <span>pulse-agent-linux-amd64</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Linux arm64 -->
        <div class="download-card">
          <div class="download-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"></rect>
              <line x1="9" y1="1" x2="9" y2="4"></line>
              <line x1="15" y1="1" x2="15" y2="4"></line>
              <line x1="9" y1="20" x2="9" y2="23"></line>
              <line x1="15" y1="20" x2="15" y2="23"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="download-card-title">Linux arm64 (aarch64)</h3>
          <p class="download-card-meta">Raspberry Pi 4 and 5, AWS Graviton, Ampere, Oracle Cloud arm64 (6.9 MB).</p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/miftahganzz/Pulse/releases/latest/download/pulse-agent-linux-arm64" 
            class="btn btn-secondary"
            style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;"
          >
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg>
            <span>pulse-agent-linux-arm64</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Installation Instructions -->
      <div class="legal-container" style="margin-top: 48px; max-width: 100%;">
        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>macOS gatekeeper note</h2>
          <p>Pulse is open-source software built directly from source. When opening for the first time, macOS may show a prompt indicating the developer is unverified.</p>
          <p>To launch the application:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Right-click Pulse.app in your Applications folder and select <strong>Open</strong>, then click <strong>Open</strong> in the confirmation prompt.</li>
            <li>Alternatively, remove the quarantine attribute in Terminal:</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="code-snippet-box" style="margin-top: 14px;">
            <code>xattr -d com.apple.quarantine /Applications/Pulse.app</code>
            <button 
              type="button" 
              class="btn-copy" 
              onclick="window.copySnippet('xattr -d com.apple.quarantine /Applications/Pulse.app', this)"
              aria-label="Copy xattr command"
            >
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
              <span>Copy</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>Server setup via curl</h2>
          <p>To install the agent and configure the systemd unit in one step, execute:</p>
          <div class="code-snippet-box" style="margin-top: 14px;">
            <code>curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/miftahganzz/Pulse/main/agent/pulse-agent/scripts/install.sh | sudo bash</code>
            <button 
              type="button" 
              class="btn-copy" 
              onclick="window.copySnippet('curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/miftahganzz/Pulse/main/agent/pulse-agent/scripts/install.sh | sudo bash', this)"
              aria-label="Copy install script"
            >
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
              <span>Copy</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">For non-root user environments, omit <code>sudo bash</code> to install to <code>~/.local/bin</code>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
